# patches/*.patch are applied verbatim with `git apply` against a vendor
# checkout with core.autocrlf=false (see scripts/pipeline.py apply_patchset),
# and their SHA256 is pinned in upstream.lock.json. A checkout of THIS repo
# with core.autocrlf=true would otherwise materialize them as CRLF and break
# both git apply and the pinned hash (Astra audit, BLOCKER_002_ASTRA_AUDIT.md
# section 6). Force LF regardless of host autocrlf configuration.
patches/*.patch text eol=lf
